'''Quicksilver Flask''' is a [[utility flask]] base type. It can have [[list of utility flask modifiers|utility flask modifiers]] (one prefix and one suffix at most).

==Modifiers==
{{Main|List of modifiers for utility flasks}}

{{Item unique versions}}

== Usage ==
Quicksilver Flasks are used in some vendor recipes for increased movement speed on boots:


1. For Crafting {{c|magic|Magic}} Boots with {{c|mod|10% increased Movement Speed}}:
* Combine {{c|normal|Normal}} Boots, Quicksilver Flask, and {{il|Orb of Augmentation}} at a vendor.

2. For Crafting {{c|magic|Magic}} Boots with higher values of movement speed:
* Combine {{c|magic|Magic}} Boots or {{c|rare|Rare}} with {{c|mod|x% increased Movement Speed}}, Quicksilver Flask, and {{il|Orb of Augmentation}}.
* This recipe outputs {{c|magic|Magic}} Boots with 5% higher movement speed (and no other modifiers), up to a maximum of 30% ({{ml|MovementVelocity5}}; T2). 

{{Item acquisition}}

{{Item skin list}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a base flask duration of 2.00 seconds instead.

